      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>Result for performHandwritingGesture(HandwritingGesture,Executor,IntConsumer) when HandwritingGesture was cancelled. This happens when the InputConnection is or becomes invalidated while performing the gesture, for example because a new InputConnection was started, or due to InputMethodManager.invalidateInput.</para>
